---

<section class="section" id="contact">
	<div class="container">
		<div class="cta-box">
			<span class="eyebrow">04 — Next</span>
			<h2>Tell us about your setup.</h2>
			<p>
				The more you tell us, the more we automate. A home, a business, or both — every build starts with the same
				question: what do you want to be able to do without thinking?
			</p>
			<div class="cta-actions">
				<a href="mailto:hello@keystone.build" class="btn btn-primary">Book a discovery call</a>
				<a href="#services" class="btn btn-ghost">Browse services</a>
			</div>
			<p class="cta-note">No spam. One reply from a human. Usually within one business day.</p>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>